## Policy limits

- Labels are plain text, 1-20 characters; tones are `neutral`, `info`, `positive`, `warning`, or `negative`.
- Conditions are concrete, observable, and at most 240 characters. Table cells cannot contain pipe characters.
- Agent types are normalized names of at most 64 characters, or `*`; ownership is `agent`, `task`, or `agent and task`.
- Never put raw commands or output, matched source text, prompts, responses, secrets, credentials, hook payloads, or transcript paths in a policy or signal.
